1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
What wakes me up is ambition, but what keeps me awake is the fire within.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,000
If I let silly sadness delay me, I'll never catch up with anyone.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Life always gives us two roads, the easy path of comfort, or the bold path of dreams.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Ambition is the breath I take each day, but passion, passion is the soul of my existence.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Every morning we get to choose, live on autopilot, or live chasing what sets our hearts on fire.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
There are days I'm tired, burnt out, but I keep going, because the game isn't over,

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,000
and we're the ones writing the story of our lives.

8
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
//

